  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southeast Asia Aviation Workshop Series, through Futron Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a series of six (6) Southeast Asia Aviation Workshops to provide a broad range of managerial, technical, safety, efficiency, capacity, and operational training to key officials from civil aviation authorities, airport management groups, air navigation providers, and individual airport operators in Southeast Asia. The workshops serve as a forum where representatives from U.S. industry and government engage Southeast Asian counterparts to collaborate on best practices, standards, and policy development for the region&apos;s aviation industry.</narrative>
  </description>
